    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD YOUR TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your team to perfection with <strong><i>player</i></strong> and <strong><i>coach</i></strong> cards in your quest to bring trophies home to your loyal fans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEEP YOUR FANS HAPPY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it's by winning games, signing high quality players, or upgrading your arena, appeasing your fanbase will lead to higher gameday attendance and better financials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>POWER TO THE PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The slimmest of margins can be the difference between winning and losing games. Provide your players the edge they need with <strong><i>powerup</i></strong> cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RISE TO GLORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone loves a good underdog story! Earn promotion and avoid relegation as you battle your way from the lowest league to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NO MICROTRANSACTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">None of that pay-to-win nonsense seen in other card-based sports games. Everything you need to succeed is at your disposal - even cheat codes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD YOUR TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your team to perfection with <strong><i>player</i></strong> and <strong><i>coach</i></strong> cards in your quest to bring trophies home to your loyal fans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEEP YOUR FANS HAPPY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it's by winning games, signing high quality players, or upgrading your arena, appeasing your fanbase will lead to higher gameday attendance and better financials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>POWER TO THE PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The slimmest of margins can be the difference between winning and losing games. Provide your players the edge they need with <strong><i>powerup</i></strong> cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RISE TO GLORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone loves a good underdog story! Earn promotion and avoid relegation as you battle your way from the lowest league to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NO MICROTRANSACTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">None of that pay-to-win nonsense seen in other card-based sports games. Everything you need to succeed is at your disposal - even cheat codes.</p>",
